  "description": "WAXFIN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H132 N6 O6 Yb3,2(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb4A (Yb) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.384-3.386 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.81-90.21°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb3L6]·2C7H8 (L = 2,6-iPr2C6H3NC(O)Ph); C128H148N6O6Yb3.",
